('Life history', 'lifespan', 'Plant lifespan, the duration from germination to death. Lifespan refers to the death of both aboveground and belowground biomass, indicating the death of the genetic individual.', 'a', 'num', 'Lifespan', '13', '0.1', '10000.0', TRUE),
