(NULL, 'woodiness', 'A binary trait, indicating whether a plant''s stems are woody, with woody broadly defined to include both `true wood` (secondary xylem) and taxa that do not produce secondary xylem (i.e. monocots and ferns) but have thick, stiff, robust lignified stems.', NULL, 'cat.', 'Woodiness', NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE),
