('Descriptive', 'plant_physical_defence_structures', 'The presence (or explicit absence) of specific physical defence structures on a plant, including spines, thorns, prickles, and sharp-tipped leaves.', NULL, 'cat.', 'Physical defence structures', '11', NULL, NULL, TRUE),
